# Step 2: public/data is a build artifact regenerated from src/data by
# artifacts/dean-dashboard/scripts/gen-public-data.ts (vercel.json build + local pre* hooks).
artifacts/dean-dashboard/public/data/

# raw IPEDS pulls cached by research/build-cc-universe.mjs
research/.cc-raw/

# succession-panel/ IS committed, as loose CSVs. It was briefly the other way round --
# the zip in git, the CSVs ignored -- which put an opaque 11MB binary under version
# control and hid the data it contained. For a research repo the preference runs the
# other way: CSVs diff, review and blame line by line, and the zip is built from them
# on demand (.github/workflows/succession-panel.yml uploads it as a CI artifact).
